% The two scopes lib/flatzinc/compile.ml decomposes rather than handing to [Alldiff]:
% a CONSTANT operand, which becomes a disequality per variable, and the variables that
% remain, which become the global. `all_different_int([p, q, 2])` is therefore
% `all_different_int([p, q])` plus `p <> 2` plus `q <> 2`, and the answer is forced:
% p and q must take 1 and 3 between them, and p <= q picks which.
var 1..3: p :: output_var;
var 1..3: q :: output_var;
constraint all_different_int([p, q, 2]);
constraint int_le(p, q);
solve satisfy;
